<section class="content-panel content"><h2>Location</h2>
<p>The music room is located in room 400. Only Edgerton residents will be able to make reservation for the music room.</p>
<hr>
<h2>Rules of Music Room</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>You must reserve the room online before using it</strong></li>
<li>Wipe down equipment before and after use. There are sanitizing wipes in the room [COVID-19 Policy]</li>
<li>Only play music between 10am and 10pm</li>
<li>If you open the window while playing drums, all courtyard rooms can hear you. Someone will probably complain on eh-open</li>
<li><strong>Do not remove equipment from the room</strong></li>
</ul>
<h2>Available Equipment in the Music Room</h2>
<ul>
<li>Baby grand piano</li>
<li>3 microphones (2 mic cables)</li>
<li>2 microphone stands</li>
<li>2 15&#8243; loudspeakers</li>
<li>Bass amp</li>
<li>Acoustic amp</li>
<li>Drum kit: 3 toms (high mid low), pulse bass drum, ride cymbal, crash, high hat, snare, drum seat, standards for everything. Bass pedal with set. A couple room-sticks. Tuning key. Mute pack (4 pc). Damper pads (2 pc).</li>
<li>4 music stands</li>
</ul>
<hr>
